company_description:
With a strong focus on the Northwest, DATS Recruitment & CAD Services has almost 60 years'​ experience of partnering with UK engineering companies. 

Within DATS Recruitment, our consultants are experts in their own specialist technical market, fulfilling our clients'​ contract and permanent roles at all levels, from Graduate to Director. 

Our expertise lies in recruiting across the following disciplines:

-	CAD/Revit/BIM Professionals;
-	Process Engineering Professionals;
-	Mechanical Design Engineers;
-	EC&I Design Engineers;
-	Civil & Structural Designers & Engineers;
-	Engineering project support staff (Technical Authors, Document Controllers etc.).

It’s not easy to attract and retain the best engineering talent; when the time comes to add to your team, DATS is a specialist technical consultancy that genuinely knows its candidates, markets and clients. The fact we specialise in the Northwest means we have strong, longstanding relationships with the best candidates in the industry. 


DATS CAD Services covers the length and breadth of the UK and our friendly, helpful team is always happy to visit our clients to review and understand their requirements. With no project too big or too small, we're flexible enough to help in difficult circumstances, such as tight deadlines or the project being on the wrong software package.

We've extensive knowledge and experience of the building services, R&D, scientific, production and process industries, meaning we're well placed to offer you innovative CAD solutions. 

With a strong reputation for delivering projects accurately and on time for clients, we're particularly proud to continue to work with some of our original clients, from 50+ years ago, which have since become major international organisations.  

DATS is ISO 9001:2015 compliant.

A Consultants Group by Tegon tem como atividades principais projetos de transformação empresarial e realizou com sucesso dezenas de projetos nas áreas de:

Gestão Temporária de negócios;
Convergência Estratégica;
Transformação Organizacional;
Desenvolvimento de Liderança;
Processos&Tecnologia - e-RH;
Diagnóstico de RH;
Recrutamento e Seleção.

Recruitment agency Emigra Inc, established at 2010, is successfully working and co-operating with various employers from most of EU countries such as Netherlands, Germany, Norway, Spain, Cyprus, United Kingdom and etc.
We have strong relationship with employees and employers because our main value is to provide quality service to each part. We are always striving for excellence and seeking for now partners and providing international and multicultural experience for the candidates.

WHY US?
• Our candidates stay in their positions for long period of time and do not leave it soon;
• We have an experienced and skilled recruiting team of 5 members who works in this sphere for more than 8 years;
• We get at least 60 CV every week;
• We have GLA license since 2014;
• We provide and encourage candidates to find their own accommodation when it is needed and organize their travel details for you;
• We are always growing and learning to out-best our goals;
• We are here to save Your time!

Jobfinder, a company established in 2004, has solidified its position as an effective supplier of recruitment services for Polish and foreign customers. We specialize in direct recruitment of high-class employees for all ranks in sales and management divisions and for specialist positions. 

The scope of services of our company has been constructed in a manner that it makes it easier for companies to meet their strategic and operational objectives by entrusting the recruitment processes to an external specialized supplier. 

Our competitive advantages include:

✅ Care for presentation to our customers of candidates that accurately comply with their requirements;

✅ An extensive database, containing information about our candidates, that allows us to commence cooperation even today;

✅ As a company without an extended administrative structure, we can provide top-level services at moderate prices;

✅ Working based on remuneration paid after the processing of an order (success fee), our customers pay only when we have complied with their expectations;

✅ Customers cooperate with people, not with a company, which means that we are personally liable for the processing of your order, and we accept liability for the success of your recruitment project.

Our mission is to create tailored client solutions which focus on emerging technologies to improve employee retention, increase productivity and activate thoughtful community initiatives.

Our long-term aspiration is to provide job training to underprivileged minority youths, with an emphasis on starting a business, to establish generational wealth. We understand that building an environment which furnishes the tools to teach and inspire future generations to create businesses and gain the knowledge to generate opportunities for themselves, will allow young people in impoverished communities to thrive independently and financially.

2bFocused provides professional resources for business operations and continuity purposes. Our executive team brings over 25 years of experience managing large teams in the IT and Administrative Enterprise environments. Our core competencies are staff augmentation, workforce planning and professional development. Over the last 5 years we have provided proficient resources to support the staffing, training, project management and incumbent takeover needs of our commercial and government clients, to assist with fulfilling their short and long-term service obligations.

SBA 8(a) and EDWOSB, PA of NY&NJ, NYC and NYS MW/SBE certified.

✦ Managed over 1300+ FTEs; 
✦ Over 25 years of corporate management and team building experience;
✦ Expert at project management strategies;
✦ Professional and software applications training;
✦ Adept at boosting productivity;
✦ Government approved Software Licenses reseller.

Call 845-313-8345 or email support@2bfocused.com for more information.

SPECIALTIES: 
✔ Staff Augmentation and Incumbent Takeovers;
✔ Workforce Planning;
✔ Custodial and Facilities Management;
✔ Acquisition Support; 
✔ Business Support Services;
✔ Professional Development Training;
✔ Call Center Support.
